text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_0816FDF0 {
    "Grumble...\pWhat happened to the others who went\nto FALLARBOR? They’re late..."
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_0816FE3E {
    "Grumble...\pI’d like to ride the CABLE CAR to the\ntop, too.."
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_0816FE7A {
    "Eh, I’d like to get to MAUVILLE, but if\nI went down these ledges, it’d be no\leasy matter to get back to LAVARIDGE."
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_0816FEED {
    "MT. CHIMNEY CABLE CAR\n“A short walk ル way!”"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_0816FF19 {
    "MT. CHIMNEY\p“For LAVARIDGE TOWN or the summit,\nplease take the CABLE CAR.”"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_0816FF64 {
    "ROUTE 112\nロ LAVARIDGE TOWN"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB619 {
    "Hahahaha!\nHow about we have a battle?\lYou and me!\lHahahaha!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB655 {
    "I lost!\nHahahaha!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB667 {
    "Hahahahaha! Something flew up my nose!\nHahahaha-hatchoo!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB6A0 {
    "My legs are solid from pounding up\nand down the mountains.\pThey’re not going to buckle easily,\nfriend!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB707 {
    "Ouch! My legs cramped up!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB721 {
    "Try hiking, and I mean really\npounding, on these mountain trails\lwith a heavy pack weighing dozens of\lpounds.\pThat, my friend, will get your body\ninto serious shape."
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB7C7 {
    "I’ve been keeping fit by hiking.\nPower, I have in spades!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB801 {
    "I got trumped in power?"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB819 {
    "I hear there are some seriously tough\nTRAINERS on top of MT. CHIMNEY.\pI intend to get up there and give them\na challenge!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB893 {
    "I’m strong.\nI won’t cry if I lose."
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB8B6 {
    "Waaaah!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB8BE {
    "I’m not crying because I miss my mommy!\nSnivel..."
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB8F0 {
    "When you’re out on a picnic, why, you\nsimply have to sing!\lCome on, sing with me!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB942 {
    "Oh, you’re so strong!"
}

text Naranja_Route112_G00_M27_Text_081BB958 {
    "It doesn’t matter if you’re good or bad\nat singing or POKéMON.\pIf you have the most fun, you win!"
}
